invite.body:
Hello! You have been invited to join {{orgName}} as a guest on $t(common:layout.app_name_compact). Follow this link to accept:
{{baseUrl}}/invite/{{token}}

If you don't have an account yet, sign up with this email address and the invitation is accepted automatically.

login.body:
Hello! Click the link to sign in to $t(common:layout.app_name_compact). It is valid for 15 minutes and can only be used once:
{{link}}

If you did not request this link you can ignore this email. Don't forward it: whoever has the link can sign in as you.

welcome.body:
Welcome to $t(common:layout.app_name_compact)! An account for {{email}} is created when you sign in for the first time. Click the link to sign in. It is valid for 15 minutes and can only be used once:
{{link}}

If you did not request this link you can ignore this email. Don't forward it: whoever has the link can sign in as you.
